{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI am writing from Brussels, where the evening air is cool after a long day’s travel. I dined at the house of Mr. van Ghert, a man of considerable standing. His household is lively—five boys and a daughter, the eldest now seventeen. They were most gracious, sending their warmest regards to you.\n\nThe father spoke with great hope of Berlin. He intends to send his eldest son here in some four years to complete his studies. It is a fine arrangement; the boy has a steady mind, and Berlin offers the proper discipline for his final formation. I promised to keep his name in mind, that he might find a place in my circle of instruction.\n\nThe journey continues, but my spirits are good. I have taken my snuff and rested my eyes. Do not worry for me; I am well cared for.\n\nYour faithful\nGeorg"}}],"created":1795219155,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":186,"prompt_tokens":939,"total_tokens":1125,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-2UooT8ecRbJBcurbMJlZjre3IoI2WyAr","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":939,"prompt_ms":969.13,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.0320873269435569,"prompt_per_second":968.9102597174787,"predicted_n":186,"predicted_ms":4424.229,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.914751351351352,"predicted_per_second":41.81519537076404}}